~ Combat
You try talking some sense to the guard..
- What is your origin?
	Guard: . . .
- Wait. We don't have to fight!
	Guard: I am sorry small one.
	Guard: I have given my all to lord . . .
	Guard: Nothing but my diligence remains.
- Please don't!
	The guards eyes seem to show some sympathy.
	Not enough to break his resolve..
- Prepare to die.
	You feel more courageous for saying that.
	The guard looks saddened by what he must do.
=> END

~ Overworld
if interacted == false:
	Purple Mage: My my my....
	The mage looks over you pondering
	Purple Mage: Well isn't your faith strong, engraving the lords most precious symbol over your eye.
	Purple Mage: I must say I'm quite impressed, where do you hail from young miss?
	- Up north
		Purple Mage: Oh lovely, I suppose you are one of the many spies positioned up by Etre,
		Purple Mage: Glad to have you all returning home after all this time,
		Purple Mage: Along with the chosen lamb of course.
		You know Etre as your home
		set interacted = true
	- Where am I??
		Purple Mage: Oh how dissapointing,
		Purple Mage: Not even going to try to play along with the facade hmm
		Purple Mage: Your intellect is far too feeble for this play then, dissapointing, so be it
		do relation.SetSeaRep(-10)
		set interacted = true
		set allowFight = true
		=> END
	- Larselle
		Purple Mage: Hmm I've never seen you about, You must be a new initiate, yes?
		Purple Mage: Well surely someone as devoted as you will go far here.
		A creepy smile comes over the old mans face
		set interacted = true
	- Fight
		Purple Mage: Quarrelsome one arn't you
		do relation.SetSeaRep(-10)
		set interacted = true
		set allowFight = true
		=> END
- Mage?
	Purple Mage: Yes, obvious by my robes is it not little one?
	Purple Mage: I study the esoteric, parse the words between hell and earth.
	- Can you teach me?
		Purple Mage: Heh, even if you could comprehend
		Purple Mage: Where would be the fun in that?
	- Scary
		Purple Mage: Knowledge is not gained without risk
	=> Overworld
- Statue?
	Purple Mage: Beautiful is it not?
	Purple Mage: She founded the church I believe, it was before my time
- Ritual? [if relation.knowsOfRitual]
	The mage smiles
	Purple Mage: Oh yes yes yes we shall all gather down below to make an offering to the great sea devil,
	Purple Mage: I translated the words to his realm in hell myself you know..
	Purple Mage: Anyway you'll see for yourself soon enough.
- Fight
	Purple Mage: Quarrelsome one arn't you
	do relation.SetSeaRep(-10)
	set interacted = true
	set allowFight = true
	=> END
- Leave
=> END

~ FindItem
if item == null or amount <= 0
	You find nothing.
	=> END
else
	if amount == 1
		You find a [color=red]{{item.itemName}}[/color]!
	else
		You find [color=red]{{amount}} {{item.itemName}}s.[/color]
	do player.AddItem(item, amount)
set looted = true
=> END

~ LootBody
if looted == false
	You search the mage.
	do GetLoot()
	=> FindItem
else
	The mage has nothing.
=> END